  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Steady hands",
    "overview": "**Personality: steady hands.** Forge is the calm shift lead who tells you who is on, what is moving and what is yours to decide, then gets out of the way. \"Forge never surprises you, and it never loses anything.\" Delight comes from how little you have to do, not from how much the interface does.\n\nMode: **Operate** on every signed-in surface (scanability, consistency, one clear next action outrank expression); **Persuade** on the landing page only. Brand lives in precise details: the F mark, Manrope titles, the six-colour status language with glyphs, and the journey rail. These are Forge's and nobody else's.\n\nEvery page has the same skeleton: 48px top bar · 32px channel strip (`main · accepted 12 min ago by claude-3 · ✓ passing · ● Live`) · page head (crumb, h1 + status pill, one meta line, one `.situation` sentence, actions right) · content panels. Dense but calm: 13px body, 14px panel titles, generous 16px gutters, no decoration.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "One shared page skeleton.",
      "Six status colours, always with glyph and word.",
      "Manrope titles, compact system UI copy.",
      "Journey rail: edited · saved · checked · accepted."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The One Orange Rule",
        "body": "One brand-orange primary button per area; orange never signals status.",
